Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你回来多久了  萨姆  -一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long you been back, Sam? - About a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一年来你一直都在这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been back practically this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于得偿所愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finally had what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要的是我弟弟  活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted my brother, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴望的是家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是由于我们的生存方式  你才不得不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only gave it up because of the way we lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你已拥有了常人的生活  建立了家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you had something, and you were building something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经金盆洗手了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got out, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已摆脱了这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked away from the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's as close to happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是猎魔人永远不能享有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I've ever seen a hunter get.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟其他人一起干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hooked up with some other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你竟跟陌生人共事  -他们算得上家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? Working with strangers? - They're more like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格温·坎贝尔  那是克里斯蒂安和马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen Campbell. That's Christian and Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坎贝尔  就跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Campbell? Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你妈妈一个姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔  不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel? You can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得是救了萨姆的东西将我复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're guessing whatever pulled sam up pulled me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但你们还不知道它是什么  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you don't know what that is. - Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:00:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变形怪  能将自己伪装成任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shapeshifter? Something that can make itself look like anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说这种生物能衍变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legends of creatures who can transform themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:00.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何动物或人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}into animals or other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他们变形时  可能会蜕皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the shapeshifter changes shape, maybe it sheds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟一起我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我要回去陪着莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm going back for Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会让他们陷入险境的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be putting them in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那该怎样  难道撇下他们  无人保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, it's better to leave them alone, unprotected,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样他们就不危险了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they're not in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我走入了他们的生活  才使他们身陷险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made them vulnerable the moment I knocked on their door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常打给我  听到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in touch, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(厨具: 平底锅  烤箱  菜板)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码先好好看看这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least wait till you've checked the place out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再讨厌也不迟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敞开心扉  我只求你做到这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open mind. That's all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  嘿  急啥呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hey, where's the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想去看看这个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to check out the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下你妈妈自己收拾厨房吗  过来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let your mom unpack the kitchen by herself? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等会出去吃午饭  再去会会邻居  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go for lunch later, scope out the neighborhood. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  这主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, why don't you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(兰辛市  密歇根州)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪儿找到尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you find the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在楼上发现了父母的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the parents upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是非法闯入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警铃一直没响过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, alarm never went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这孩子的线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any leads on the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还没有  -你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None yet. - So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她安全吗  还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's okay? Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我不抱希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  -嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个起司披萨  一个什锦披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one cheese, one everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱给你  不用找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Keep the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为要出去吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  对啊  我忘了  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, I forgot. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找盘子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look for plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  我四处检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. So, I've been all over this --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没硫磺  没电磁反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulfur, no EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得可能没我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to think maybe it's not our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四对被屠杀的夫妇  都在同一个州同一个区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four couples slaughtered, one part of the state,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是接二连三地发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within days of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子都是反锁的  可四个婴儿都被带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's four babies taken from locked houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说普通人如何能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain to me how any version of that is natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我同意  现场非常恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I agree. It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说  这事儿也许该由警方介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, this one might be on the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我们要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, either we got monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么是些抓婴儿吃的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}grabbing babies to make baby stew,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么就是一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we got a bunch of psychotic yokels
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓婴儿吃的神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}grabbing babies to make baby stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样孩子都会被吃  这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, it's baby stew, which is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不耐烦了吗  有急事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So-- am I boring you? You got someplace you need to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没  没  我懂了  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. I get it. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我还真搞不懂你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wonder about you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我自己也搞不懂自己  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wonder about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我再把资料重新看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will go back over everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我们有没有漏掉什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if there's anything we missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  探员说房子里的警铃一直没响过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, detective said the alarm in the house never went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能快速查下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind taking a quick look,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另几家的警报系统是不是哈珀凯恩保安公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if anybody else had a system from Harper Caine Security?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在努力玩儿转电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance I get to hop on a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你乱动什么  -我只是想瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think you're doing? - I just wanted to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不许再打开这个箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever open this trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听懂没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你像我这么大的时候  都有自己的来复枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had your own rifle when you were my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本  记住我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, mark my words --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远别和枪打交道  永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never, ever shoot a gun. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.97,0:07:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得会有东西来找我们的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think something might be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能做的我也能做  你可以教我怎么用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do what you do! You could teach me how to shoot --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准再提枪  听到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up about the freakin' gun, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜对了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有被害家庭都用的那家公司的报警系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every family that got hit -- Harper Caine Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我调查了客户记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I pulled the client records.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  看看还有没有情况类似的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, to see if there's any other families who fit the profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一对幸福的夫妇  \N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is another happy couple, walking and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六个月大的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}6-month old baby --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和其他家庭一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地址告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the address?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本把自己锁在房间里几个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben's been locked in his room for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你吼他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says you yelled at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他动了我的工具箱  我不该发火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got into my tools. I shouldn't have got mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聊什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲本大吼  把我们关在这房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yelling at Ben, keeping us in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在保证我们的安全  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to keep us safe here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来吵架的好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not arguing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是内行  我只是问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the expert. I'm just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你和弟弟已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you and your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了那个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed whatever was after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  为了保险起见  我们还搬了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then -- and then we moved, just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一只怪物  还是一大批怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster? Or monsters in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只知道可能有危险  -什么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something might come. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  它还没来  我无法预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I can't predict what's gonna come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总得有个数啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna need some parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在这里生活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to live our lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且  我要上班  本要上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, at some point, I have to work. Ben has school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你们在我眼皮底下出事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if something happens on my watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想要保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're trying to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我现在怕的反而是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're kind of scaring me a little, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(警告: 该住户受哈珀凯恩保安公司保护监控)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你得帮我  就现在  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need your help. Now. - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我在跟一个案子  -老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm working this job -- - dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我只要你帮我这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just need you with me on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我退出了  彻底退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out. I'm staying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-破例一次  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make an exception! - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有三十分钟到你那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm 30 minutes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不来见我  我就开到你家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will drive to your door if you don't meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么事儿啊  你居然这样来逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's so nuts you got to threaten a damn drive-by?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绑在后座上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strapped down in the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入《宝贝计划》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party, Guttenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会弄  你之前教过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. We've been over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迁就我一次  -装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humor me. - Load clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推滑糟  关保险  开保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull slide. Safety off, safety on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还要在窗边和门后撒上盐  -明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And salt the windows and the doors. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I shouldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事儿  你想去  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You want to go, so go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆可以摆平这事的  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what? Sam can handle this. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别介意  可你要是还不走的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but if you don't walk out that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要开枪撵你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在肯定很怀念前男友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you're missing your ex right about now --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很无趣的那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the, uh, boring one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于这东西  我们知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what do we know about this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它速度很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, it was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很怕银器 \N{\fnArial\fs30}And it freaked when I cut it with silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  那范围就缩小到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so that narrows it down to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食尸鬼啊  僵尸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghoul, a zombie,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变形怪啊等等等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}a shifter, or about a dozen other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,资料里好像没说到诱拐婴儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recall seeing babynapping in the profiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是知道啥  请随便说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, feel free to speak up if you know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I, in the third grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车是用来开的  不是用来装逼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A car should drive, not be a little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没说你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't take it personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱得买点装备啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we need to get some supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车里武器应有尽有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an arsenal in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm pretty sure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有面团啊  果冻之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there's some kind of, like, paste or jelly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能涂在小屁屁上的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're supposed to put on their butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  这种行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, uh, like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  那个要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Grab that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么懂这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎有个小侄女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Lisa's got a baby niece,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就冒充了几回奶爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've been on a few milk runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哟喂  -给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh. - Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不就说个"哟喂"嘛  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said "Huh." 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说"闭嘴"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said "Shut it."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们得抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这哥们马上就要开闸放水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the waterworks in like t-minus 10, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.72,0:16:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-明白  - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛  坚持住啊哥们  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hang in there, buddy. Hang in there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  哄他别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么哄\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都看着  跟咱俩虐待儿童似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's staring at us like we're child abusers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪儿知道  我又听不懂他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You think I speak baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是该换尿布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he needs a diaper change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  希望不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫什么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-约翰  -鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby John.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀  鲍比·约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Bobby John.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个小帅哥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱抱行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  这个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  鲍比·约翰尿裤裤了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now. Bobby John's a little wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的意思  不过你俩看起来真憔悴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense -- you two look exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天知道我换了几百万片尿布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord knows I've changed a million diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您人真是太好了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's a really nice offer. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想我们应付得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh I think we've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的  我很乐意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's nothing. Happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把孩子给我  别逼我一刀扎在你脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the baby before I stab you in your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要杀人啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! He's hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快开  快...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个变形怪要这孩子干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's a shifter want with a baby, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说它又是怎么找到咱俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how the hell did it find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  这玩意儿谁设计的  宇航局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, who the designed this thing, NASA?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  从我离开这孩子家开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it could have been following me this whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他可能就一直跟着我  -不说那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Since the baby's house. - All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱得赶紧找个下脚处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get off the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给鲍比·约翰找个安全的地方栖身\N{\fnArial\fs30}get, uh, Bobby John here someplace safe, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再想对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}figure this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  宝宝不哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. Shh! Shh! Easy, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(禁止入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监控台86号  请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, 86. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要查一辆伊利诺斯车的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a 10-28 on Illinois plates --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车牌号是"I4ZO892"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I" As in India, 4, zulu, oscar, 8, 9, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你看这样行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我花钱雇你躺着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay you money if you sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本就是拆除便便炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is like defusing an I.E.D. With poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  行啦  换完啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  你是宝贝鲍比·约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You are golden, Bobby John.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该睡觉觉咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to hit the hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你那样还得把他招哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you're just gonna make it cranky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说话  管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好咯  我要把你放下去 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if I put you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:19:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要像个男子汉一样哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna be a man about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're just, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话...真是不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually... Not awful at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  在我手里他还能活着是他命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm barely keeping that thing alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是  说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是超级奶爸附身啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a whole Dr. Huxtable vibe coming off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是...当爹的料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like... Father material.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  最近确实当爹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I kind of had to be lately, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硬着头皮上呗  你说对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sink or swim, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说本\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我是说本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我知道他不是我亲生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know he's not my kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我也不清楚  我好像开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- I don't know, I'm starting to feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他当亲生的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次想到咱们是怎么长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I think about the way we grew up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I kind of feel like I have a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让本的好过一点  你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do something different with Ben, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:20:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你显然在意那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You clearly care about the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  让他们四处漂泊  闭门不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...Moving them around, keeping them on lockdown...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实让他们闭门不出  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you do have them on lockdown, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和你我成长的环境有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is any of that different from how we were raised?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你的意思是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让任何人卷入这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not shoving anybody into this life, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得老爸总说那是一时的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad always said it was temporary, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"一时"持续了22年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it for 22 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你的初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.63,0:21:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要保护他们  这再好不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to watch out for them. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just asking --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么做  才不会像爸爸那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do that and not turn into dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  我怎么会漏掉这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap. I can't believe I missed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,榆树街上的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house on Elm --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母亲被杀  婴儿被抢\N{\fnArial\fs30}the -- the mother was killed, baby was grabbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那时父亲不在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but daddy wasn't living in the house at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找他谈谈如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we go and have a chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你能给鲍比·约翰找个警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you got a badge for Bobby John,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我必须留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道不错  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  要是死了也就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i-it's one thing to die like...that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失得无影无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还真是没用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们申请离婚了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had filed for divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在外面偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}she cheated on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.64,0:23:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被我抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, I caught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道对方是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did you know the other man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.47,0:23:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  我没有抓到现行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I mean, I didn't catch her catch her,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...she lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很久没有做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hadn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.25,0:23:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you know, in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  她突然就怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and then -- then she's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.96,0:23:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她怎么说  -她说孩子是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did she say?  - She said it was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  "这不可能"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and I said, "That's impossible,"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信她说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and "What is she talking about?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说"难道你不记得你出城那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she says, "Don't you remember when you went out of town 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.45,0:23:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提早回来了  然后我们就..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you came back early and we..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在参加垒球锦标赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at a damn softball tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.27,0:23:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论那是谁  他才是孩子的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever he was, he's the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和父亲谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没问题  但是那婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He checks out. But the baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.62,0:24:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.41,0:24:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想它父亲是变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the shapeshifter is its dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.96,0:24:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是管理员  里面没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manager. Everything okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我们  我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, we're -- we're -- we're fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接到一些投诉  能开下门吗  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been complaints. You mind opening the door, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.19,0:24:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚洗完澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just -- just got out of the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:23.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别挡道  -我不会让你得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the way.  - Yeah, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.25,0:25:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿应该和他父亲在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child should be with his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.98,0:25:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to be honest --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你们俩没丁点相象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really seeing the family resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.68,0:25:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没说我是他父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.00,0:25:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.89,0:25:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,押金拿不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there goes our deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.03,0:26:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  这招还真妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's pretty smart, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.95,0:26:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变形怪假扮成在保安公司工作的警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, shifter poses as a guard for the security company
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以便接近那房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get near the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后研究这个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it scopes out the fam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.66,0:26:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  爸爸出门  变形怪就来冒充他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Then daddy takes off, and the shifter becomes daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝几杯酒  跟妈妈嘿咻一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few glasses of wine, shakes mama's trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九个月后回来带走它的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes back in nine months to collect its prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.44,0:26:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道它们还能生娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know they had babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为它们只不过是天生的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they were just freaks of nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟X战警一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like -- like X-men style.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  所谓活到老学到老是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you learn something new every day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.79,0:26:33.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没见过怪物婴儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a baby monster before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.39,0:26:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来  它还不是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it's not really a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还只是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's still just a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是它的错  谁让它爹是变形怪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not its fault its dad's a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.77,0:26:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没错  但它还是个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. But it's a shifter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:43.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也改变不了我们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still doesn't change the fact that we've got to --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.44,0:26:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要照顾它的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got to look after this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要拿它怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what the hell are we gonna do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.52,0:26:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不能把它扔给孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't actually drop it off at an orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.12,0:26:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是它变成亚洲人会引起恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might get upset when it turns asian.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:26:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:26:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把它带给一群猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to bring it to a bunch of hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.73,0:27:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不只是猎魔人  迪恩  他们是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not just hunters, Dean. They're our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.67,0:27:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不了解他们  - 我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know them.  - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.90,0:27:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是每个猎人都神经兮兮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not every hunter is a head case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  萨穆埃尔跟你就很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Samuel is actually a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.68,0:27:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个神经兮兮的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a freakin' head case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  你出个更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...pitch a better idea, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.18,0:27:20.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我们这就去找萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Samuel it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.70,0:28:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁比你伪装得更好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you just the best disguise
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.95,0:28:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a monster ever wore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就开个玩笑嘛  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.57,0:28:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也有话要说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.25,0:28:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  好  那你就站那里打量我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? All right. Well, you just stand there and think at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们下一步怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.21,0:28:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒有几个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a couple ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.86,0:28:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  给我抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, let me see the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.10,0:28:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我抱着就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.85,0:28:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I'm gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.76,0:28:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't want me to answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.69,0:28:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底觉得我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who exactly do you think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.12,0:28:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.11,0:28:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.36,0:28:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是自家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I've been thinking we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不要吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Let's not get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不吵就不吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Let's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.99,0:28:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.08,0:29:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我来抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.47,0:29:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.86,0:29:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,个头可真不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a big fella, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久没抱过这样的小家伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I haven't held one of these in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.59,0:29:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈那会可瘦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom was the tiniest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小脑袋上光秃秃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was bald as a cue ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.72,0:29:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么处理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what the hell are we gonna do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养大他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养大他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.99,0:29:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你有什么其他建议吗  -但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, you got another suggestion? - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.06,0:29:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他丢在外面太危险了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous out there for him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.69,0:29:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.57,0:29:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们难道要解刨研究他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are we gonna study him, poke at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你思想太扭曲了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind goes right to torture, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.45,0:29:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别以为大家都跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't assume that for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.80,0:29:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.62,0:29:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  听说你在下面折磨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I heard about what you majored in,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.80,0:29:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,折磨得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}down in the pit?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不爽个毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is your problem, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我越看你越不顺眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're starting to become a pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.28,0:29:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯蒂安  给个面子  他是我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christian, take it easy, man. He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.08,0:29:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都唧唧歪歪完没\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all done bristling up here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.73,0:30:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会把他怎么样  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's doing anything to him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.55,0:30:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他长大  我们就告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he's old enough, we throw it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要愿意帮助我们  那最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to volunteer to help out, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.49,0:30:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.27,0:30:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.23,0:30:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想他会成为什么样的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the kind of hunter he'll grow up to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.94,0:30:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都搞笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all are joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.36,0:30:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能就这么领养个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't... Angelina Jolie a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.91,0:30:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把孩子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就不肯相信我呢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you give me an inch of trust, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.11,0:30:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许因为你们俩突然死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because you two are suddenly back from the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而只有我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I seem to be the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.91,0:30:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对整件事十分好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wants to know how the hell that happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不光你想知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些所谓家人太神秘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just a little too much mystery with this family
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.34,0:30:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就别管了  别总针对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then don't. But don't put it on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.14,0:30:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想让你融入这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we're trying to do is invite you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-克里斯蒂安  -在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christian. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和艾琳还是怀不上孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Arlene, still no luck on the baby front?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.43,0:30:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.63,0:30:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们还想要孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.31,0:31:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.77,0:31:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  -放心  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, hold on. - It's okay, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.41,0:31:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.44,0:31:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.19,0:31:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个男孩  算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a boy...Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.14,0:31:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家终于有后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crap I do for this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.42,0:31:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是来真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.48,0:31:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪凉快哪待着去  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.85,0:31:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不可能抚养一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you have no business raising anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为他是猎魔人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.15,0:31:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去楼下避难室  那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downstairs -- panic room. He'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.93,0:31:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有我们  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it! Go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.39,0:32:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抢了我们的"人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.58,0:32:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.73,0:32:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能感觉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.31,0:32:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-马克  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mark! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.34,0:32:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松  大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.81,0:33:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿银网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the silver nets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.82,0:33:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna box him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.40,0:33:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别哭了  鲍比·约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bobby John.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.08,0:33:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去他们不太妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not sound good up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.76,0:33:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我上去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.89,0:33:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩老实待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.03,0:34:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-把孩子给我  -没门儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the baby. - No way in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.55,0:35:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在看来肯定确有其事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure it's not a myth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.66,0:35:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.61,0:35:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.97,0:35:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们认为可能是始祖  -什么始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We think it may have been an Alpha. - An Alpha? Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.08,0:35:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个怪物总有一个祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all monsters come from somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得这个是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that this one was the...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.83,0:35:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变形怪始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.50,0:35:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生育其他后代的第一代变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one who spawned all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面学问可多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's tons of lore about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.33,0:35:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.35,0:35:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以它有如此强大的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it was so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我们无法阻止它的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why nothing we had stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.59,0:35:32.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说过这婴儿在哪儿他都能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he said that he could find the baby anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.89,0:35:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能感觉到  它们之间有灵犀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he could feel it, like there's a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.31,0:35:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中也有提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's in the lore, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.27,0:35:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它究竟为什么要这个婴儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's it want with babies, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.94,0:35:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,组个垒球队吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Softball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.89,0:35:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.24,0:35:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.61,0:35:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  我们怎么干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, how do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.28,0:35:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道能否干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.31,0:35:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在旅馆把那变形怪干掉之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before you, uh, ganked that shifter in the motel,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.51,0:36:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它提到了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}he mentioned a father,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.62,0:36:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在看来说得通了  原来它是说始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes sense now 'cause he meant the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.61,0:36:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也觉得是  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Yeah, I guess so. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.35,0:36:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到它说的话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear him say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.47,0:36:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.20,0:36:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况紧急  没注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a hot moment, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, 'cause if you heard him,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.39,0:36:25.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就知道这个始祖的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}then -- then you knew the Alpha was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.53,0:36:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.31,0:36:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道始祖存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you knew the Alpha was out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.53,0:36:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就知道它会寻找这婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you knew he might come after the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话  你就可以用孩子做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, you were using the baby as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.92,0:36:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是这么计划的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, was that the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-利用婴儿做诱饵  -当然不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To use the baby as bait?  - Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.31,0:36:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我只是觉得萨穆埃尔那儿最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I just thought Samuel's was the safest place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.28,0:36:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.75,0:36:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.94,0:37:04.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没抓到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它杀了我们三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It killed three of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用麻醉大象的麻醉枪射它  根本不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot it full of elephant tranquilizer, and it chuckled!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.51,0:37:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实讲  我不确定是否想找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I'm not sure I want to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.26,0:37:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会找到方法把它抓住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, we will find a way to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.31,0:37:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  行  我会把它包装好  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. I'll bring it right to you -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.29,0:37:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为礼品带给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}gift-wrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.26,0:37:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where's Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.28,0:37:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在骑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bike ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.18,0:37:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.40,0:37:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道要怎么办  莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't -- I don't know what to do here, Lis.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.71,0:37:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我知道怎样才能让你们最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if I knew for sure what the safest thing was,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.79,0:37:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会去做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd do it --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.51,0:37:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在这里  保护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay here and look after you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.15,0:38:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是走得越远越好  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or get as far away as I possibly can, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.65,0:38:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.06,0:38:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我最近某些行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get what I've been doing lately, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.93,0:38:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大声呵斥什么的  还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the yelling and the...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.86,0:38:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个狱警一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}acting like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.69,0:38:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你们当犯人看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a prison guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.71,0:38:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是  不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just -- that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.67,0:38:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诫自己不能成为这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell yourself you're not gonna be something, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸曾经的行为就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my dad was exactly like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.03,0:38:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.22,0:38:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我真的很怕和他一样  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it scared the hell out of me. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:38.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能说句实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I be honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.01,0:38:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿我们或许会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're safer with you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.59,0:38:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是你离开更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.90,0:38:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.42,0:38:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确信的一点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing that I do know
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.95,0:38:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是个建筑工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you're not a construction worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.95,0:38:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一个猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.11,0:38:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你弟弟出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you know your brother's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.25,0:38:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就变得不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:39:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不想呆在这儿了  -不  我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't want to be here, Dean. - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.17,0:39:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.45,0:39:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但  但你也想跟你弟弟一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but -- but you also want to be there, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.19,0:39:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么活着会很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're white-knuckling it, living like this, 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.44,0:39:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像你真的是什么凶神恶煞一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what you really are is some bad, awful thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.85,0:39:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But... You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.29,0:39:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会在每次你临行前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna have this discussion
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.01,0:39:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.35,0:39:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会不断离开  所以我只说这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just gonna keep happening, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.48,0:39:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能丢下你和本不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't just lose you and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.92,0:39:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不是这个意思  -你说让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not what I'm saying. - You're saying hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.50,0:39:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  如果规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if there's some rule
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.27,0:39:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这必须要有所取舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}that says this all has to be either-or...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.21,0:39:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们破了这规定如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout we break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.14,0:40:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和本会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Ben will be here, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.82,0:40:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能来的时候就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.92,0:40:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我完好无损地回来  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come in one piece, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.47,0:40:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我们这样做合适吗  有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you really think we could pull something like that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.33,0:40:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得一试  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot, right?
